
== queue two prompts during a turn
┌ chat
│ ## You
│ first
│ 
│ ## prigh
│ first answer
│ 
│ ⏸ queued: second
│ ⏸ queued: third
└
winbar: prigh · claude-sonnet · thinking medium · mode Default · ● running · queued 2
input bar: <CR> send · <C-c> cancel · @ file · / command · g? keys · 2 queued

== <C-c>: cancel, queued prompts back in the input
notify: prigh: 2 queued prompts moved back to the input
┌ chat
│ ## You
│ first
│ 
│ ## prigh
│ first answer
│ 
│ ℹ cancelled
│ 
└
input: { "second", "third", "with two lines" }
winbar: prigh · claude-sonnet · thinking medium · mode Default
input bar: <CR> send · <C-c> cancel · @ file · / command · g? keys

== a queued prompt is sent when the turn ends
┌ chat
│ ## You
│ first
│ 
│ ## prigh
│ first answer
│ 
│ ℹ cancelled
│ 
│ ## You
│ second
│ 
│ ## prigh
│ second answer
│ 
│ ## You
│ third
│ 
│ ⚠ stopped: reached the token limit
│ 
└
